== Remote Watch Training ==
On the remote server, start TensorBoard bound to localhost and port 6006:
    tensorboard --logdir=. --port=6006

On your local machine, open a second terminal and establish an SSH tunnel that forwards 
a local port (say 6006) to the remote’s TensorBoard port:
    ssh -L 6006:localhost:6006 AP09650@replica.logti.etsmtl.ca

Then open your web browser and go to:
    http://localhost:6006

